    "# Welcome to Plainbook!\n",
    "\n",
    "Plainbook lets you create notebooks using plain language.\n",
    "Instead of writing code, you describe what you want in natural language,\n",
    "and Plainbook generates the code for you.\n",
    "\n",
    "Try clicking on a cell below and pressing the **Run** button to generate and execute the code."
